; Deliberately NOT carried over from Vercel:
;   *      ALIAS cname.vercel-dns-017.com.        (wildcard — Vercel routing only)
;   @      ALIAS 3dd7f720c7ad4051.vercel-dns-017.com.
; The wildcard is why every probed subdomain used to resolve. Dropping it means
; www needs its own record, which it now has.

$TTL 300

; --- site ---
zonymouslabs.com.                      300 IN A     199.36.158.100
www.zonymouslabs.com.                  300 IN CNAME zonymous-website.web.app.

; --- email (Spacemail) — do not touch without checking deliverability ---
